# 7. Data Source, Provenance & Ethics

These CSV files come from a processed extract of **MIMIC-IV**, a credentialed-access clinical dataset hosted on PhysioNet.

### Key Ethical Requirements:
- Do NOT attempt to re-identify patients  
- Dates and identifiers are shifted or removed  
- Ages above 89 may be bucketed  
- Use data only for academic / non-commercial work  
- Respect HIPAA-safe guidelines  

Include the full provenance in your `report_part1.md`.

